@title Build mode: a device on the door says where it goes from the hinge edge and shows on the door
@area Cabinet
# S0 and S1 are on the door in this fixture. Their steps give the position from the hinge edge, and Show on the door opens the door surface.
open qa/fixtures/door-device.novo
wait 20
click_text Reports
wait 5
click_text "Build mode..."
wait 30
click_text "Devices  0/8"
wait 10
click_text "23  =A1+CAB-S0"
wait 10
expect "Fit =A1+CAB-S0 on the door"
expect "from the hinge edge"
expect "Show on the door"
shot door-step
check_layout
click_text "Show on the door" Button
wait 20
expect "Back to Build mode"
shot on-the-door
check_layout
click_text "Back to Build mode" Button
wait 10
expect "from the hinge edge"
